        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The lampad begins a heart-wrenching fit of weeping, inspiring sympathetic sobbing in nearby creatures. Each enemy creature within @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30 feet} who hears the lampad's weeping must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:24] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} and unable to use reactions for 1 round as it sobs uncontrollably. No matter the result of the save, the creature is then immune to this Lampad's Weep until it dies.</p>"
